  {
    "id": "c89f670ea5832b6b",
    "text": "{变量1} · {变量2}\nOnce completed, {分支3} adds a heavy freight train crew of 8 people, able to carry up to 768 items per direct shipment; the existing 4-person service vehicle carries 192 items per shipment and continues to handle relay transfers, family relocation, and cross-city commuting. Actual load size is still limited by the goods’ value and the remaining allowance for the current period.\nKeeps 6 maintenance workers on staff, consuming {变量4} every 60 seconds, equivalent to 108 value per period, charged to the local community budget. Each trip on a heavy freight train costs twice as much as on the original service vehicle; round-trip time is unchanged.\nAfter operations are suspended, routine maintenance and new bulk freight train dispatches stop. Trains already in transit still unload along their original routes and return empty to the yard."
  },
  {
    "id": "60561dbfd35a371b",
    "text": "Construction requires {变量1}, deducted directly from the local public warehouse’s building materials; 30 workers assemble it over 360 seconds, without using the shared operating allowance for each period.\n"
  }
